# v0.9.1 Phase 8 Task 32 — introspect coros JSON shape.
#
# `coros` is the one introspection primitive the re-founded service
# carries; the other eight walked structures the runtime no longer has in
# that shape and return with the networked server.
#
# The answer is emitted INLINE as the value — an introspect answer is
# already JSON — so the key appears verbatim rather than escaped the way
# the eval path's string-wrapped value does.
#
# introspect emits a result and no done: `done` marks the end of an
# eval's output, and an introspect produces none.

## mode: repl

> {"id":3,"op":"introspect","what":"coros"}
< "id":3 | "kind":"result" | "coros"
